Stable Fast 3D source is based on Stability-AI/stable-fast-3d at
ff21fc491b4dc5314bf6734c7c0dabd86b5f5bb2. Stable Point Aware 3D source is
based on Stability-AI/stable-point-aware-3d at
fdc311b16809e6a8adc2f5a3407ebb3db1a95bd1.

This distribution adapts the source for Apple Silicon, including MPS
attention and Metal texture baking, and adds LocalAI adapters for mesh
reduction, UV unwrapping, and textured GLB export. The model checkpoints
are obtained separately from Stability AI.

The LocalAI gRPC bindings in shared/proto are derived from LocalAI. See
shared/proto/LICENSE.md for the upstream MIT license.
